	<string>Copy a prompt (Claude plugins, any repo or folder of Markdown files, your own) to the clipboard. Type to filter, ↩ opens a collection or copies a prompt, ⌘⌫ goes back, ⌘⇧r updates the prompts (needs git and jq), ⌘⇧. edits and tests the sources. Configure the sources and your custom prompts in Configure Workflow.</string>
